    <bpmn:process id="W_W3044" name="W3044. Data Subject Access Request (DSAR) Fulfillment &amp; Verification" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer/subject submits access request
Frequency: Event-driven
Volume: Growing volume as awareness rises
Owner: Data Protection Officer (DPO)
Participants: DPO, Customer Service, IT, Business Process Owners, Legal
Source: workflow W3044 — Data Subject Access Request (DSAR) Fulfillment &amp; Verification</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3044_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3044_Lane1" name="Customer Service">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3044_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3044_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3044_Lane2" name="IT">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3044_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3044_Lane3" name="DPO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3044_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3044_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3044_Start5" name="Customer/subject submits access request">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3044_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3044_Task6" name="Customer Service/DPO log DSAR; verify subject identity (anti-fraud)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer Service/DPO log DSAR; verify subject identity (anti-fraud); acknowledge within statutory window; route to relevant data custodians
Responsible (R): Customer Service / DPO
Accountable (A): DPO
Duration: Per request (&lt;ack SLA)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3044_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3044_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3044_Task7" name="IT/Business Process Owners retrieve all personal data held (per ROPA W3042)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: IT/Business Process Owners retrieve all personal data held (per ROPA W3042) across systems; compile response package; DPO reviews for third-party data
Responsible (R): IT / Process Owners / DPO
Accountable (A): DPO
Duration: Per request (&lt;fulfill SLA)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3044_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3044_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3044_Task8" name="DPO delivers response to subject securely; logs fulfillment; updates DSAR…">
