      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3045_Task5" name="DPO assesses request: rectification (correct inaccurate), erasure (delete where…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: DPO assesses request: rectification (correct inaccurate), erasure (delete where no lawful basis/legal hold), objection (stop specific processing)
Responsible (R): DPO
Accountable (A): DPO
Duration: Per request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3045_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3045_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3045_Task6" name="IT/Process Owners execute correction/deletion across systems and processor…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: IT/Process Owners execute correction/deletion across systems and processor copies; preserve records subject to legal hold or BIR/SEC retention (links to VS-88)
Responsible (R): IT / Process Owners / Records
Accountable (A): DPO
Duration: Per request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3045_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3045_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3045_Task7" name="DPO notifies subject of action; notifies third-party recipients of…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: DPO notifies subject of action; notifies third-party recipients of rectification/erasure obligation; logs and confirms completion
Responsible (R): DPO
Accountable (A): DPO
Duration: Per request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3045_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3045_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
